{%- comment -%}
  The review-photo lightbox. One per reviews instance; pdp-reviews.js finds it
  inside its own root by data attribute and fills it from the clicked
  thumbnail. Same shape as the UGC carousel's so the two read as one
  component.

  Lifted out of pdp-reviews.liquid because the section now renders two
  instances of the panel - the inline band and the popup - and each needs a
  lightbox of its own. Position: fixed, so it stacks above whichever wrapper
  it sits in - over the page inline, over the dialog in the popup.

  Accepts nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="revbox" data-pdp-reviews-box hidden>
  <div class="revbox__panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Review photo">
    <button type="button" class="revbox__close" data-pdp-reviews-box-close aria-label="Close">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg>
    </button>

    <div class="revbox__media">
      {%- comment -%}
        Holds the stage while the full-size photo decodes. The stage has a
        size of its own either way, so this is what is in it rather than
        what gives it its height - and it never shows for a photo already
        in cache, which is every neighbour the JS has prefetched.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <span class="pdp-reviews__skel revbox__skel" data-pdp-reviews-box-skel aria-hidden="true" hidden></span>
      <img data-pdp-reviews-box-img alt="" width="900" height="900">
      <video data-pdp-reviews-box-vid playsinline controls preload="none" hidden></video>
      {%- comment -%}
        Review video is Cloudflare Stream, which hands back a player page
        rather than a file, so it plays in its own frame. src is set and
        cleared by the JS - leaving it set would keep the video playing
        after the lightbox closes.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <iframe data-pdp-reviews-box-embed
              title="Review video"
              loading="lazy"
              allow="accelerometer; gyroscope; autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture;"
              allowfullscreen
              hidden></iframe>
    </div>

    <div class="revbox__nav">
      <button type="button" class="pdp-reviews__arrow" data-pdp-reviews-box-prev aria-label="Previous photo">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
      </button>
      <span data-pdp-reviews-box-count aria-live="polite"></span>
      <button type="button" class="pdp-reviews__arrow" data-pdp-reviews-box-next aria-label="Next photo">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
